  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023 support to IFRC regarding crises in Occupied Palestinian Territories</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">15,000,000 (TBD) people</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct support to medically evacuated persons and those accompanying them from Gaza and the 
West Bank.
Direct support to people from Egypt, Lebanon, Jordan, and Syria affected by the ongoing tensions and 
conflict spillover, including internally displaced people and host communities.
 Indirect support to the affected populations in Gaza through the continued scale-up of the ERCS 
logistics operation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILOT</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to IFRC Middle East Regional EA.
On 7 October 2023, an escalation of hostilities occurred across the Gaza Strip and the West Bank. 
As the escalation continues, the overall humanitarian situation in Gaza is rapidly plunging into desperation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The violence has led to more than 15,523 people killed, 41,316 injured , while 2.23million (the estimated population of Gaza Strip) are affected and an estimated 1.78 million people are internally displaced.</narrative>
  </description>
